   980→/**
   981→ * Find an idea by ID
   982→ *
   983→ * @param repoRoot - Repository root path
   984→ * @param ideaId - Idea ID to find
   985→ * @param customOutput - Optional custom output directory
   986→ * @returns Object with idea and session directory, or null
