  1016→/**
  1017→ * Update an idea in its file
  1018→ *
  1019→ * @param filePath - Path to the idea file
  1020→ * @param ideaId - ID of the idea to update
  1021→ * @param updates - Partial idea updates
  1022→ * @returns True if updated, false if not found
