  1084→/**
  1085→ * Get an idea by its ID
  1086→ *
  1087→ * @param repoRoot - Repository root path
  1088→ * @param ideaId - Idea ID (e.g., "a1b2c3d4")
  1089→ * @returns Idea or null if not found
